---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="ご予約ありがとうございます｜大島ニュービラ"
  description="大島ニュービラ公式予約のお支払い完了ページです。"
  noindex={true}
>
  <main class="min-h-[72vh] bg-orange-50 pt-28 pb-16 md:pt-36 md:pb-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6">
      <section class="overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-green-200 bg-white shadow-sm">
        <div class="bg-green-950 px-6 py-10 text-white md:px-10 md:py-12">
          <div class="flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-white/10 text-2xl" aria-hidden="true">✓</div>
          <p class="mt-6 text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.24em] text-green-200 uppercase">Booking Complete</p>
          <h1 class="mt-2 font-serif text-3xl font-bold leading-tight md:text-4xl">ご予約ありがとうございます</h1>
          <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-sm leading-7 text-green-50/90 md:text-base">
            お支払いを受け付けました。予約確定メールをお送りしていますので、内容をご確認ください。
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 md:p-10">
          <div id="booking-summary" class="hidden">
            <div class="rounded-2xl bg-stone-50 p-5 md:p-6">
              <dl class="grid gap-5 text-sm sm:grid-cols-2">
                <div>
                  <dt class="text-xs font-bold tracking-wider text-gray-500">予約番号</dt>
                  <dd id="summary-code" class="mt-1 font-bold text-gray-900"></dd>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <dt class="text-xs font-bold tracking-wider text-gray-500">宿泊施設</dt>
                  <dd id="summary-product" class="mt-1 font-bold text-gray-900"></dd>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <dt class="text-xs font-bold tracking-wider text-gray-500">宿泊日</dt>
                  <dd id="summary-dates" class="mt-1 font-bold text-gray-900"></dd>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <dt class="text-xs font-bold tracking-wider text-gray-500">宿泊人数</dt>
                  <dd id="summary-guests" class="mt-1 font-bold text-gray-900"></dd>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <dt class="text-xs font-bold tracking-wider text-gray-500">お支払い金額</dt>
                  <dd id="summary-price" class="mt-1 text-xl font-bold text-gray-900"></dd>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <dt class="text-xs font-bold tracking-wider text-gray-500">確認メール送信先</dt>
                  <dd id="summary-email" class="mt-1 break-all font-bold text-gray-900"></dd>
                </div>
              </dl>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div id="booking-summary-fallback" class="rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 bg-stone-50 p-5 text-sm leading-7 text-gray-700">
            ご予約内容の詳細は、予約確定メールをご確認ください。
          </div>

          <div class="mt-8 border-t border-stone-200 pt-7">
            <h2 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">このあとについて</h2>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-gray-600">
              チェックイン方法・アクセス・ご滞在にあたっての重要事項は、宿泊前に改めてご案内します。
              予約確定メールが届かない場合は、迷惑メールフォルダもご確認ください。
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row">
            <a
              href="/guest-guide/"
              class="inline-flex min-h-12 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-green-800 px-7 py-3.5 text-sm font-bold text-white shadow-md transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-green-700"
            >
              宿泊ガイドを見る
            </a>
            <a
              href="/"
              class="inline-flex min-h-12 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-stone-300 bg-white px-7 py-3.5 text-sm font-bold text-gray-800 transition hover:bg-stone-50"
            >
              公式サイトへ戻る
            </a>
          </div>

          <p class="mt-8 text-xs leading-6 text-gray-500">
            ※決済処理と予約確定メールの送信には、数秒程度かかる場合があります。
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>

  <script>
    const formatYen = (value) => {
      const amount = Number(value);
      return Number.isFinite(amount) ? `¥${amount.toLocaleString('ja-JP')}` : '—';
    };

    const formatDate = (value) => {
      if (!value) return '';
      const [year, month, day] = value.split('-').map(Number);
      if (!year || !month || !day) return value;
      return new Intl.DateTimeFormat('ja-JP', {
        year: 'numeric',
        month: 'long',
        day: 'numeric',
        weekday: 'short',
      }).format(new Date(year, month - 1, day));
    };

    try {
      const raw = sessionStorage.getItem('onv_pending_booking');
      if (raw) {
        const booking = JSON.parse(raw);
        document.getElementById('summary-code').textContent = booking.bookingCode || '—';
        document.getElementById('summary-product').textContent = booking.productName || 'SALVIA｜集まる家';
        document.getElementById('summary-dates').textContent = `${formatDate(booking.checkIn)} 〜 ${formatDate(booking.checkOut)} ／ ${booking.nights ?? '—'}泊`;
        document.getElementById('summary-guests').textContent = `${booking.guestCount ?? '—'}名`;
        document.getElementById('summary-price').textContent = formatYen(booking.totalPrice);
        document.getElementById('summary-email').textContent = booking.customerEmail || '—';
        document.getElementById('booking-summary').classList.remove('hidden');
        document.getElementById('booking-summary-fallback').classList.add('hidden');

        window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || [];
        window.dataLayer.push({
          event: 'booking_complete_page_view',
          booking_code: booking.bookingCode,
          booking_product: 'salvia-standard',
          check_in: booking.checkIn,
          check_out: booking.checkOut,
          guest_count: booking.guestCount,
          nights: booking.nights,
          value: booking.totalPrice,
          currency: 'JPY',
        });
      }
    } catch (error) {
      console.error('Booking summary restore failed:', error);
    }
  </script>
</Layout>
